
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>ChatterBox | Admin Dashboard</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f3f6fb;
      color: #1e293b;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .topbar {
      background: #111827;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 18px 5%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .brand h1 {
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .brand p {
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 5px;
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .nav a {
      color: #d1d5db;
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav a:hover,
    .nav a.active {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .nav a.active {
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .logout-form {
      display: inline;
    }

    .logout-btn {
      background: #374151;
      border: 1px solid #4b5563;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .logout-btn:hover {
      background: #4b5563;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1150px, 92%);
      margin: 36px auto;
    }

    .welcome-section {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .welcome-section h2 {
      font-size: 29px;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .welcome-section p {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .admin-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #ede9fe;
      color: #5b21b6;
      padding: 9px 14px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .section-heading {
      font-size: 19px;
      margin-bottom: 17px;
      color: #1e293b;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 38px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 13px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    .stat-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    }

    .stat-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .stat-label {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .stat-icon {
      width: 43px;
      height: 43px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .users-icon {
      background: #dbeafe;
    }

    .messages-icon {
      background: #dcfce7;
    }

    .members-icon {
      background: #f3e8ff;
    }

    .stat-number {
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .stat-description {
      margin-top: 9px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .admin-section {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 13px;
      padding: 26px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }

    .admin-section > p {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: -8px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .action-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .action-card {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 11px;
      color: #1e293b;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s,
        transform 0.2s;
    }

    .action-card:hover {
      border-color: #a5b4fc;
      background: #f8faff;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .action-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 23px;
    }

    .action-users {
      background: #dbeafe;
    }

    .action-messages {
      background: #dcfce7;
    }

    .action-content {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .action-content h3 {
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .action-content p {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .action-arrow {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 22px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 30px 15px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .topbar {
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .nav {
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .stats-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .stat-card:last-child {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .topbar {
        padding: 17px 4%;
      }

      .nav {
        width: 100%;
        gap: 12px 16px;
      }

      .container {
        width: 92%;
        margin: 26px auto;
      }

      .welcome-section h2 {
        font-size: 25px;
      }

      .stats-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .stat-card:last-child {
        grid-column: auto;
      }

      .stat-card {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .action-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .admin-section {
        padding: 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="brand">
      <h1>ChatterBox Admin</h1>
      <p>Welcome, <%= user.firstName %>!</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/admin" class="active">Dashboard</a>
      <a href="/admin/users">Manage Users</a>
      <a href="/admin/messages">Manage Messages</a>

      <form
        class="logout-form"
        action="/login/logout"
        method="POST"
      >
        <button class="logout-btn" type="submit">
          Log Out
        </button>
      </form>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="welcome-section">
      <div>
        <h2>Dashboard Overview</h2>
        <p>Monitor your community and manage your application.</p>
      </div>

      <span class="admin-badge">
        <span>●</span>
        Administrator
      </span>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="stats-heading">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="stats-heading">
        Community Statistics
      </h2>

      <div class="stats-grid">
        <article class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-top">
            <span class="stat-label">Total Users</span>
            <span class="stat-icon users-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              👥
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="stat-number"><%= totalUsers %></p>
          <p class="stat-description">Registered accounts</p>
        </article>

        <article class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-top">
            <span class="stat-label">Total Messages</span>
            <span class="stat-icon messages-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              💬
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="stat-number"><%= totalMessages %></p>
          <p class="stat-description">Messages shared in the community</p>
        </article>

        <article class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-top">
            <span class="stat-label">Club Members</span>
            <span class="stat-icon members-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              ⭐
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="stat-number"><%= totalMembers %></p>
          <p class="stat-description">Users with club membership</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Administration</h2>

      <p>
        Manage user accounts and moderate messages in your community.
      </p>

      <div class="action-grid">
        <a class="action-card" href="/admin/users">
          <span class="action-icon action-users" aria-hidden="true">
            👥
          </span>

          <span class="action-content">
            <h3>Manage Users</h3>
            <p>View, create, edit, and manage user accounts.</p>
          </span>

          <span class="action-arrow" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        </a>

        <a class="action-card" href="/admin/messages">
          <span class="action-icon action-messages" aria-hidden="true">
            💬
          </span>

          <span class="action-content">
            <h3>Manage Messages</h3>
            <p>Review community messages and delete inappropriate posts.</p>
          </span>

          <span class="action-arrow" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    ChatterBox Administration
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
